{"unit_id":"keeshakulbida948-tech__dsh-plugin-sticker#card-zh","repo":"keeshakulbida948-tech/dsh-plugin-sticker","commit":"a4a38ff797e298d753b8e6cc5503130ac62fb7cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-sticker 是一款面向 DSH web 的表情包插件，可让聊天中的 AI 搜索图库并发送贴图。它在 DSH 注册 list_stickers 和 send_sticker 两个工具，并提供浏览器端工具卡片，将选中的图片以内嵌方式显示在对话中。用户可以按情绪、主题、关键词、编号或文件名查找图片；搜索结果包含编号、画面描述、情绪和标签，发送时支持模糊匹配。插件还通过 webServer 提供图片路由供页面读取。适合希望在网页聊天中快速插入情绪贴图、活跃对话气氛的用户。使用前需要图库索引和图片文件，可用 DSH_STICKER_DIR 指定图库目录，不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:89-132","index.js:135-197","index.js:199-247","client.js:77-100"]}
{"unit_id":"keeshakulbida948-tech__dsh-plugin-sticker#card-en","repo":"keeshakulbida948-tech/dsh-plugin-sticker","commit":"a4a38ff797e298d753b8e6cc5503130ac62fb7cb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-sticker lets DSH web chats search and send stickers. It registers search and send tools and embeds images in chat. Search by mood or keyword, then choose by number, filename, or matching phrase. A local gallery and index are required; DSH_STICKER_DIR can select a custom gallery.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:89-132","index.js:135-197","index.js:199-247","client.js:77-100"]}
