{"unit_id":"keeshakulbida948-tech__dsh-plugin-sticker#feature-1","repo":"keeshakulbida948-tech/dsh-plugin-sticker","commit":"a4a38ff797e298d753b8e6cc5503130ac62fb7cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-sticker 的功能「按情绪搜索贴图」：list_stickers 根据关键词匹配图库的主题、情绪、标签和文件名。调用时传入 query，返回最多 20 条编号、描述和标签信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:58-83","index.js:95-132"]}
{"unit_id":"keeshakulbida948-tech__dsh-plugin-sticker#feature-2","repo":"keeshakulbida948-tech/dsh-plugin-sticker","commit":"a4a38ff797e298d753b8e6cc5503130ac62fb7cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-sticker 的功能「按名称发送贴图」：send_sticker 接受编号、文件名或情绪主题词，并从图库索引解析最匹配的图片。工具调用返回图片信息，由 web 客户端呈现发送结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:135-197","index.js:252-265"]}
{"unit_id":"keeshakulbida948-tech__dsh-plugin-sticker#feature-3","repo":"keeshakulbida948-tech/dsh-plugin-sticker","commit":"a4a38ff797e298d753b8e6cc5503130ac62fb7cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-sticker 的功能「对话内嵌图片」：send_sticker 成功后，浏览器端工具卡片按调用参数加载对应图片，并在聊天气泡中显示。图片从同源 /sticker-img 路由读取，支持延迟加载。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:31-100","index.js:199-234"]}
{"unit_id":"keeshakulbida948-tech__dsh-plugin-sticker#feature-4","repo":"keeshakulbida948-tech/dsh-plugin-sticker","commit":"a4a38ff797e298d753b8e6cc5503130ac62fb7cb","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-sticker 的功能「自定义图库目录」：启动时读取 DSH_STICKER_DIR 指定的图片目录，未设置时使用插件目录下的 stickers。图库索引仍由 assets/stickers.json 提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:22-26","index.js:89-93"]}
